# Individual: coho:COHO_0001701 (obsolete European Prospective Osteoporosis Study)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0001701 coho:COHO_0001420)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001701 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. In the only paper the PGS Catalog records the id EPOS in (PMID:35654975), it is the EPoS Consortium's liver-biopsy cohort from the European NAFLD Registry, not an osteoporosis study. The Catalog's expansion, European Prospective Osteoporosis Study, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0001420 (LITMUS Metacohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001701 "obsolete European Prospective Osteoporosis Study"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001701 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

