AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001847 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. HDAAM is the dbGaP study 'High Density SNP Association Analysis of Melanoma: Case-Control and Outcomes Investigation' (phs000187), under which the MD Anderson melanoma GWAS deposited its data (PMID:21926416). Replaced by COHO:0000875 (MD Anderson Cancer Center melanoma study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001847 "obsolete High Density SNP Association Analysis of Melanoma"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001847 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

