# Individual: coho:COHO_0001885 (obsolete Icelandic Atrioventricular Block Sample)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0001885 coho:COHO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001885 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. No paper names the id, but every Icelandic genetic sample of advanced atrioventricular block is a deCODE genetics case set, drawn from Icelanders in deCODE's studies (PMID:20062063, PMID:23583979): the sample is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that disease subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001885 "obsolete Icelandic Atrioventricular Block Sample"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001885 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

