# Individual: coho:COHO_0001904 (obsolete Icelandic ECG study sample)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0001904 coho:COHO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001904 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic ECG sample is deCODE genetics' set of genotyped Icelanders with stored electrocardiograms from Landspitali University Hospital, listed as 'Study cohort: deCODE' in PMID:30012220: it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001904 "obsolete Icelandic ECG study sample"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001904 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

