# Individual: coho:COHO_0001943 (obsolete Juvenile Diabetes Research Foundation/Wellcome Trust Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratorys British case collection)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0001943 coho:COHO_0001013)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0001943 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Checked 2026-09-23: The PGS Catalog records no score or paper for this id (its REST record is empty); the name is copied from Todd et al. 2007 (PMID:17554260). The PGS Catalog name is the source of the id: Todd et al. 2007 calls the case sample 'the JDRF/WT Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratory's JDRF/WT British case collection (Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes)', so the JDRF/WT British case collection is GRID, already in COHO as COHO:0001013 (whose definition already says it was assembled by the JDRF/WT Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratory). Add JDRF/WT as an acronym and the collection names as synonyms, and obsolete the placeholder COHO:0001943 in favour of COHO:0001013. Replaced by COHO:0001013 (Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0001943 "obsolete Juvenile Diabetes Research Foundation/Wellcome Trust Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratorys British case collection"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0001943 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

