AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0002065 coho:COHO_0000116)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002065 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MGS_nonGAIN is the second genotyping phase of the Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia case-control sample ('The remainder of the sample (called “nonGAIN” here) was genotyped in the same laboratory several months later', PMID:19571809). The Catalog's name describes only that phase and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000116 (Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia Collaboration), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
