# Individual: coho:COHO_0002100 (obsolete Medical University of Vienna)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002100 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. MUV is the PGS Catalog's id for the BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutation carriers that the Medical University of Vienna (Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology, General Hospital Vienna) contributed to the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1/2 (CIMBA, COHO:0000901). CIMBA itself names this study only 'General Hospital Vienna' (PMID:28346442 Supplementary Table 1; PMID:32665703 supplement), so it is a centre's unnamed set of carriers, not a named cohort. It is a site of CIMBA, like OUH and OSUCCG, which the review already marked as not cohorts. Not to be confused with DNMUV (COHO:0001672, Department of Neurology, Medical University of Vienna). Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002100 "obsolete Medical University of Vienna"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002100 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

