# Individual: coho:COHO_0002151 (obsolete Northern Institute for Cancer Research)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002151 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. NICR is the PGS Catalog's id for 23 childhood B-cell precursor acute lymphoblastic leukaemia cases, with no study name, from the Northern Institute for Cancer Research (Leukaemia Research Group, Newcastle University, UK). They were included in the UK-GWAS of PMID:27694927 ('23 cases from the Northern Institute for Cancer Research (16 males)'). This is an institute's unnamed handful of cases, not a named cohort. The other UK-GWAS samples already have COHO terms or are other catalog ids: UK Childhood Cancer Study COHO:0000178, 1958 British Birth Cohort COHO:0000207, WTCCC COHO:0000182. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
