# Individual: coho:COHO_0002161 (obsolete University of Colorado Health Center/National Jewish Research Center and Arkansas Childrens Hospital)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002161 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. NJRCACH is not a cohort: its name joins two of the five participating sites of the NIH Consortium of Food Allergy Research (CoFAR) EoE Cohort, 'University of Colorado Health Center/National Jewish Research Center' and 'Arkansas Children’s Hospital' (PMID:29904099). That cohort is already in COHO as the CoFAR Eosinophilic Esophagitis Registry (COHO:0001429, which carries the PGS id USNIHFAREE's name 'US NIH CoFAR EoE cohort'). No PGS Catalog score uses NJRCACH, so it is at most the Catalog's label for those two sites' share of the CoFAR EoE participants, with no study name of its own. The two institution names should not be added to COHO:0001429 as synonyms. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002161 "obsolete University of Colorado Health Center/National Jewish Research Center and Arkansas Childrens Hospital"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002161 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

