AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002180 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. Novel Risk Factors and Potential Early Detection Markers for Ovarian Cancer is the name several Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium tables give its study HOP (PMID:23535730, PMID:27698005), which the consortium elsewhere names Hormones and Ovarian Cancer Prediction. Replaced by COHO:0001872 (Hormones and Ovarian Cancer Prediction Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002180 "obsolete Novel Risk Factors and Potential Early Detection Markers for Ovarian Cancer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002180 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

