AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002204 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Ottawa Heart Study of PMID:28209224 cites the design paper of the Ottawa Heart Genomics Study (PMID:17478681) and has its design. Replaced by COHO:0002202 (Ottawa Heart Genomics Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002204 "obsolete Ottawa Heart Study"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002204 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

