AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002247 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. PEGASUS-TIMI_54 is the PEGASUS-TIMI 54 trial of ticagrelor after myocardial infarction, pooled with other TIMI trials in the papers the PGS Catalog records the id in (PMID:33185476, PMID:36474045, PMID:41419686). Replaced by COHO:0002246 (Prevention of Cardiovascular Events in Patients with Prior Heart Attack Using Ticagrelor Compared to Placebo on a Background of Aspirin), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25."@en)
