# Individual: coho:COHO_0002359 (obsolete Service de Neurologie Mazarin, Groupe Hospitalier Pitié-Salpêtrière Paris)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002359 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. SdNM is the PGS Catalog's id for the Service de Neurologie Mazarin (neuro-oncology department) of the Pitié-Salpêtrière hospital group in Paris, the site through which the 1,495 glioma patients of the French GWAS were ascertained (PMID:28346443). The sources give the case series no name of its own, no recruitment design beyond ascertainment at the department, and no study identity apart from 'the French GWAS', whose controls come from a separate cohort (SU.VI.MAX). The id denotes a hospital department's unnamed set of patients, so it is not a cohort. No COHO term or review row covers it. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002359 "obsolete Service de Neurologie Mazarin, Groupe Hospitalier Pitié-Salpêtrière Paris"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002359 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

