# Individual: coho:COHO_0002377 (obsolete Sheba Medical Centre)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002377 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. SHMC is the PGS Catalog's id for the Chaim Sheba Medical Center (Tel Hashomer, Ramat Gan, Israel) as a CIMBA contributing site: the BRCA1 and BRCA2 pathogenic-variant carriers from its oncogenetics unit that entered the OCAC/CIMBA ovarian cancer GWAS (PMID:28346442) and CIMBA's PRS analyses (PMID:32665703). CIMBA's own lists name the study only after the hospital ('Sheba Medical Centre', 'SMC-CIMBA'), and no source gives it a name, design or recruitment of its own. This is the same case as LUHR (E651, Landspitali), so it is not a cohort. No COHO term covers it; CIMBA is COHO:0000901. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002377 "obsolete Sheba Medical Centre"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002377 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

