AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002380 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. Sikh GWAS is the Punjabi Sikh type 2 diabetes GWAS sample of PMID:23300278, drawn from the Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study, which the paper says is also named the Sikh Diabetes Study. The Catalog's name describes that analysis and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0001116 (Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27."@en)
