# Individual: coho:COHO_0002516 (obsolete Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 coho:COHO_0002516 coho:COHO_0002517)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002516 "Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id ULM is the Ulm prostate cancer case-control study of the PRACTICAL consortium (PMID:29892016, PMID:33623038). Every score that uses it is a cancer score, so the Catalog's name for it, Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0002517 (Familial Prostate Cancer Study Ulm), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002516 "obsolete Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002516 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

