# Individual: coho:COHO_0002525 (obsolete University of Florida)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002525 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. UOF is the PGS Catalog's id for 145 African-ancestry DNA samples (61 with type 1 diabetes, 54 controls, 30 with type 2 diabetes) from the University of Florida Diabetes Institute. PMID:30659077 used them as its independent replication group, and PGS sample set PSS000031 carries only this id. The paper names the source only as the University of Florida (E1179.7, E1179.13) and gives no study name, design or recruitment period. The paper's named collections (T1DGC, SEARCH, GoKinD, Barbara Davis Center) are separate sources. Not a cohort. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002525 "obsolete University of Florida"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002525 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

