# Individual: coho:COHO_0002557 (obsolete Womens Cancer Program at the Samuel Oschin Comprehensive Cancer Institute)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002557 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. WCPSOCCI is the PGS Catalog's id for OCAC's study LAX: ovarian cancer patients of the Women's Cancer Program at the Samuel Oschin Comprehensive Cancer Institute, Cedars-Sinai Medical Center, Los Angeles, collected since 1989 with data taken from medical records (PMC5625672 Table 1; PMID:28346442). OCAC names it only by the programme and the acronym LAX. It has no study name, design or defined recruitment of its own beyond being the programme's patients, so it is an unnamed institutional collection. Not a cohort. The CIMBA group from the same programme is E1212 (WCRI). Cedars-Sinai's MIRIAD IBD biobank (COHO:0000716) is unrelated. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002557 "obsolete Womens Cancer Program at the Samuel Oschin Comprehensive Cancer Institute"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002557 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Individual: coho:COHO_0002558 (obsolete Womens Cancer Research Institute - Cedars-Sinai Medical Center)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0002558 "Obsoleted 2026-09-24. WCRI is the PGS Catalog's id for CIMBA's group WCP: BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutation carriers from the Women's Cancer Program at Cedars-Sinai Medical Center, Los Angeles (PMID:32665703 supplement; PMID:28346442; PMID:29058716). CIMBA names the group only by the clinical programme, with no study name or recruitment protocol of its own. That matches how other CIMBA institution groups in this review were decided (UPENN, UCSF, MSKCC, FCCC, KUMC and OUH are all 'not a cohort'). Not a cohort. The same programme's OCAC contribution is E1211 (WCPSOCCI). Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0002558 "obsolete Womens Cancer Research Institute - Cedars-Sinai Medical Center"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0002558 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

